    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing to \"be.\" there's no soul left to live in this shell. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting a broken machine. it's not even about \"finding a new way\" anymore. it's just the constant, heavy realization that the core of who i am is just... gone. it feels so wrong to keep this body going when the person it belonged to isn't even here anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
